 "remarks": "Live in a place that feels like summer year round! Water views from all of the rooms in the Dolphin Cove waterfront association with club house, swimming pool, tennis, beach, and boat access just steps from the house. First floor primary suite, three bedrooms upstairs, plus full bathroom and den in walk out lower level. (can be used as 5th bedroom) Spacious kitchen with island, separate laundry. Living room and dining room both open to large deck overlooking pool. Close to downtown Stamford, Old Greenwich village and trains to NYC. Glamorous, perfect retreat. Available furnished or unfurnished.",
